'''Bianca Censori''' (born 5 January 1995) is an Australian performance artist,<ref name=":0">{{Cite web |date=12 December 2025 |title=Bianca Censori Melds Flesh and Furniture in Her Surreal Performance Art Debut |url=https://news.artnet.com/art-world/bianca-censori-peformance-art-bio-pop-2728632 |access-date=23 December 2025 |website=Artnet News |language=en-US}}</ref> known for her relationship with American rapper [[Kanye West]], whom she married in a private ceremony in December 2022.<ref>{{Cite web |date=13 January 2023 |title=Kanye West and Yeezy Architect Have Private Wedding Ceremony |url=https://www.tmz.com/2023/01/13/kanye-west-yeezy-architect-have-private-wedding-ceremony-bianca-censori/ |access-date=10 June 2024 |website=TMZ}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=Kanye West's Wife Bianca Censori 'Tried to Get Out' of 'Unhappy' Marriage Before He Went to Rehab (Exclusive) |url=https://people.com/kanye-west-wife-bianca-censori-unhappy-marriage-before-rehab-exclusive-11895325 |website=People.com |access-date=30 January 2026}}</ref>

== Early life and education ==
Bianca Censori was born on 5 January 1995, in [[Melbourne]], one of three children born to Alexandra and Elia "Leo" Censori. Her paternal grandparents were natives of [[Giulianova]], [[Abruzzo]], Italy, and emigrated to Australia with their five children.<ref>{{Cite web|first=Antonella|last=Rossi|url=https://www.vanityfair.it/article/la-famiglia-italiana-di-bianca-censori-ci-ha-snobbati-ci-sarebbe-piaciuto-conoscerla-quando-e-venuta-in-italia|title=La famiglia italiana di Bianca Censori: «Ci ha snobbati, ci sarebbe piaciuto conoscerla quando è venuta in Italia»|trans-title=Bianca Censori's Italian family: "She snubbed us, we would have liked to get to know her when she came to Italy"|website=[[Vanity Fair (magazine)|Vanity Fair]]|location=Italy|publisher=[[Condé Nast]]|date=11 October 2023|access-date=7 June 2024|language=it}}</ref>

Censori attended Melbourne's [[Carey Baptist Grammar School]]<ref>{{Cite web |last=Peppin |first=Hayley |date=19 November 2023 |title=Kanye West and Bianca Censori reportedly "taking a break" |url=https://harpersbazaar.com.au/who-is-bianca-censori-kanye-west-reported-wife/ |access-date=7 February 2024 |website=Harper's Bazaar Australia}}</ref> and has a bachelor's and master's degree in architecture from the [[University of Melbourne]].<ref>{{Cite web |date=14 January 2024 |title=Kanye West and Wife Bianca Censori Go on Shopping Trip in Los Angeles |url=https://www.elle.com/culture/celebrities/a42485172/who-is-bianca-censori-kanye-west-wife/ |access-date=7 February 2024 |website=[[Elle (magazine)|Elle]]}}</ref> She was a student of architecture at DP Toscano Architects based in [[Collingwood, Victoria]].{{Citation needed|date=August 2026}} Censori created the Nylons Jewelry brand after graduating from high school.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Haasch |first=Palmer |title=Who is Bianca Censori, the Yeezy architectural designer who reportedly 'wed' Kanye West |url=https://www.businessinsider.com/who-is-bianca-censori-kanye-west-yeezy-2023-1 |access-date=7 February 2024 |website=Business Insider}}</ref>

In 2007, she met businessman Nick Forgaine, with whom she had a relationship from 2014 to 2020.<ref>{{cite web |last=James |first=Faye |date=8 February 2025 |title=Inside Bianca Censori's connection with high school sweetheart amid Kanye West controversy |url=https://www.hellomagazine.com/celebrities/812820/inside-bianca-censoris-connection-with-high-school-sweetheart-amid-kanye-west-controversy/?viewas=amp |access-date=8 February 2025 |website=Hello!}}</ref>

== Work ==
According to her LinkedIn profile, Censori is a designer at [[Yeezy (company)|Yeezy]], [[Kanye West]]'s clothing and apparel company.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Bianca Censori - YEEZY {{!}} LinkedIn |url=https://www.linkedin.com/in/bianca-censori-442728119 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241028234955/https://www.linkedin.com/in/bianca-censori-442728119 |archive-date=28 October 2024 |access-date=29 May 2025 |website=www.linkedin.com |language=en |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |first1=Stephen |last1=Brook |first2=Ashleigh |last2=McMillan |date=14 January 2023 |title=Former Melbourne architect becomes global celebrity after 'marrying' Kanye West |url=https://www.smh.com.au/culture/celebrity/former-melbourne-architect-becomes-global-celebrity-after-marrying-kanye-west-20230114-p5ccho.html |access-date=7 February 2024 |website=The Sydney Morning Herald}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last1=Film |first1=Laura Donaldson |last2=Reporter |first2=T. V. |date=13 January 2023 |title=Who is Bianca Censori|url=https://www.newsweek.com/who-bianca-censori-kanye-west-yeezy-architect-married-1773573 |access-date=7 February 2024 |website=Newsweek}}</ref>

Most of Censori's work surrounds her husband, Kanye West. She directed the music video for "[[Father (Kanye West song)|Father]]" featuring [[Travis Scott]], from his album ''[[Bully (album)|Bully]]''.<ref>{{cite web |title=Father featuring @travisscott directed by @biancacensori BULLY OUT NOW|url=https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWbOg0OjqK6/?igsh=MTc4bGhxeWV5eTc0Mw== |website=instagram.com |publisher=ye |access-date=28 March 2026 |date=28 March 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=FATHER @ye ft. @travisscott Directed by me @biancacensori|url=https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWbOg0OjqK6/?igsh=MTc4bGhxeWV5eTc0Mw== |website=instagram.com |publisher=biancacensori |access-date=28 March 2026 |date=28 March 2026}}</ref> Both the album and the music video were released on 28 March 2026.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Cowen |first=Trace William   |last2=Shifferaw |first2=Abel |date=28 March 2026 |title=Kanye West Drops ''Bully'' Album, Shares 'Father' Video f/ Travis Scott |url=https://www.complex.com/music/a/tracewilliamcowen/kanye-west-bully-album-stream-bianca-censori-father-video-travis-scott |url-status=live |access-date=28 March 2026 |website=Complex |language=en}}</ref> Censori is also credited with directing the music videos for West's singles "[[Gemini Season]]", as well as "[[King (Kanye West song)|King]]" and "[[OK (Kanye West song)|OK]]" featuring [[Don Toliver]].<ref>{{cite web |last1=Hassan |first1=Sohail |title=Kanye West and Bianca Censori drop steamy 'Gemini Season' music video on rapper's birthday |url=https://www.thenews.com.pk/latest/1405258-kanye-west-drops-the-gemini-season-music-video-featuring-bianca-censori |access-date=8 June 2026}}</ref>

In December 2025, Censori debuted an art show in [[South Korea]] which included nude female replicas dressed in [[bondage (BDSM)|bondage]], displayed as [[human furniture]].<ref>{{cite news |title=Kanye West says he's 'so proud' of wife Bianca Censori after she reveals bizarre human furniture|url=https://www.ladbible.com/entertainment/celebrity/kanye-west-bianca-censori-bio-pop-human-furniture-496155-20251231 |access-date=12 January 2026 |work=Dazed |date=31 December 2025 |language=en|url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260104080824/https://www.ladbible.com/entertainment/celebrity/kanye-west-bianca-censori-bio-pop-human-furniture-496155-20251231 |archive-date=4 January 2026}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Dazed |date=2025-12-17 |title=Bianca Censori on BIO POP, her new show about ‘objectification’ |url=https://www.dazeddigital.com/art-photography/article/69311/1/bianca-censoris-bio-pop-objectification-domesticity-seoul-korea-interview-2025 |access-date=2026-08-28 |website=Dazed |language=en}}</ref><ref name=":0" />

