==Relationship with Kanye West==
Censori legally married West in December 2022 under a [[Marriage certificate#Confidential marriages|confidential marriage license]], marking Censori's first and West's second marriage.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Porterfield |first=Carlie |date=13 January 2023 |title=Kanye West Reportedly Married Again—What To Know About Bianca Censori |url=https://www.forbes.com/sites/carlieporterfield/2023/01/13/kanye-west-reportedly-married-again---what-to-know-about-bianca-censori/ |access-date=29 February 2024 |website=[[Forbes]]}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |last=Friedman |first=Vanessa |date=25 March 2024 |title=Has Fashion Canceled Canceling? |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/25/style/fashion-cancel-culture.html |access-date=25 July 2024 |work=The New York Times |language=en-US |issn=0362-4331}}</ref> In September 2023, police in [[Venice]] were reported to be investigating West and Censori over "acts contrary to public decency" after the couple posted photos of themselves on a [[water taxi]] with West's pants pulled down and buttocks exposed, and Censori's head in his lap.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Duran |first=Anagricel |date=5 September 2023 |title=Venice police are reportedly investigating Kanye West and Bianca Censori's boat exposure incident |url=https://www.nme.com/news/music/venice-police-are-reportedly-investigating-kanye-west-and-bianca-censoris-boat-exposure-incident-3493546 |access-date=8 February 2024 |website=[[NME]]}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Omar |first=Ayan |date=7 February 2024 |title=Who is Kanye West's wife Bianca Censori? |url=https://www.standard.co.uk/showbiz/kanye-west-wife-bianca-censori-raincoat-b1052933.html |access-date=7 February 2024 |website=Evening Standard}}</ref> Censori appears on the album cover of ''[[Vultures 1]]'' (2024), the debut album of [[¥$]], a [[hip-hop]] [[superduo]] consisting of West and American singer [[Ty Dolla Sign]].<ref>{{Cite web|last1=Ech |first1=Joey |last2=Fitzgerald |first2=Trent |date=10 February 2024 |title=Kanye West's Wife Bianca Censori Appears in NSFW Pose on Vultures 1 Album Cover |url=https://www.xxlmag.com/kanye-west-bianca-censori-nsfw-pose-vultures-1-cover/ |access-date=10 February 2024 |website=[[XXL (magazine)|XXL]]}}</ref>

At the [[2025 Grammy Awards]], Censori and West caused controversy on the red carpet when Censori appeared wearing a sheer, transparent slip revealing her fully naked body.  West, dressed entirely in black, did not address the spectacle before the two left the event shortly after. Reports surfaced that they had been removed from the ceremony, though sources close to the [[Grammys]] denied that, stating that West had simply left after walking the red carpet.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Earl |first=William |date=2 February 2025 |title=Kanye West Has Surprise Arrival at Grammys as Wife Bianca Censori Shocks With Nude Outfit Reveal |url=https://variety.com/2025/music/news/kanye-west-wife-bianca-censori-naked-grammys-red-carpet-1236294350/ |access-date=3 February 2025 |website=Variety |language=en-US}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Holland |first=Oscar |date=3 February 2025 |title=In a world of naked dresses, did one take it too far? |url=https://www.cnn.com/2025/02/03/style/bianca-censori-nude-dress-grammys-hnk-intl/index.html |access-date=5 February 2025 |website=CNN |language=en}}</ref> In February 2025, reports began to emerge that Censori was intending to divorce West after his recent antisemitic tirades.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.tmz.com/2025/02/13/kanye-west-bianca-censori-split-break-up/|title=Kanye West and Bianca Censori Splitsville|first=|last=|work=[[TMZ]]|date=13 February 2025|access-date=16 February 2025|url-status=live|archive-date=15 February 2025|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250215205515/https://www.tmz.com/2025/02/13/kanye-west-bianca-censori-split-break-up/}}</ref> However, [[Milo Yiannopoulos]] denied those reports, dismissing them as rumors.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/lifestyle/lifestyle-news/kanye-west-bianca-censori-not-divorcing-rep-denies-tabloid-rumors-1236136046/|title=Kanye West and Bianca Censori Are Not Divorcing, Rep Says, Denying "Tabloid Rumors" (Exclusive)|first=Kevin|last=Dolak|work=[[The Hollywood Reporter]]|date=13 February 2025|access-date=16 February 2025|url-status=live|archive-date=16 February 2025|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250216022237/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/lifestyle/lifestyle-news/kanye-west-bianca-censori-not-divorcing-rep-denies-tabloid-rumors-1236136046/}}</ref> Shortly after, reports emerged that the couple had married without signing a [[prenuptial agreement]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/kanye-west-bianca-censori-reported-193046555.html|title=Kanye West And Bianca Censori's Reported Split Could Get Messy Without Prenup|first=Kelly|last=Coffey-Behrens|work=Yahoo! Entertainment|date=15 February 2025|access-date=16 February 2025|url-status=live|archive-date=15 February 2025|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250215225937/https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/kanye-west-bianca-censori-reported-193046555.html}}</ref> The same month, reports surfaced that West and Censori had separated after two years of marriage. Media outlets cited sources suggesting that Censori had become uncomfortable with aspects of West's [[Views of Kanye West#2025|public behavior and controversies]]. However, a representative for the couple denied the split rumours, stating that they planned to spend [[Valentine's Day]] together.<ref>{{Cite web |date=14 February 2025 |title=Kanye West representative denies 'tabloid' rumors of Bianca Censori divorce |url=https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/music/news/kanye-west-bianca-censori-divorce-grammys-b2697950.html |access-date=22 February 2025 |website=[[The Independent]] |language=en}}</ref>

In April 2025, West previewed a song on a livestream with [[DJ Akademiks]] called "[[Bianca (song)|Bianca]]", where he begs her to come back, possibly meaning that they had split up sometime in March.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Jazmin|first=Tolliver|last2=|date=2025-04-03|title=Kanye West Says Wife Bianca Censori ‘Ran Away’ In His New Unhinged Song|url=https://www.huffpost.com/entry/kanye-west-bianca-censori-split-song_n_67eebf16e4b0509d61e320d7|access-date=August 1, 2026|website=[[HuffPost]]|language=en|archive-date=July 25, 2025|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250725054538/https://www.huffpost.com/entry/kanye-west-bianca-censori-split-song_n_67eebf16e4b0509d61e320d7|url-status=live}}</ref> On his stream, West said that Censori had to "take time to digest the tweets," suggesting that they were not together at that point.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Day 1/30 Kanye West Interview Part 2 OTW | date=3 April 2025 |url=https://rumble.com/v6rktvz-day-130-kanye-west-interview-part-2-otw.-young-thug-probation-revoked-lil-b.html?e9s=src_v1_ucp}}</ref> However, the next month the couple were seen in public in the Spanish town of [[Santanyí]].<ref>{{cite news|title=Bianca Censori steps out in a dress that makes Europeans drop their ice creams as she walks by|url=https://www.marca.com/en/lifestyle/celebrities/2025/05/19/682b7d8646163fc3318b45e2.html|publisher=[[Marca (newspaper)|Marca]]|first=J. Arturo| last= Trujillo|date=19 May 2025}}</ref> In the same month she also launched jewelry inspired by medical instruments such as [[speculum (medicine)|speculum]]s.<ref>{{cite news |title=Bianca Censori’s first jewelry collection is inspired by speculums and scalpels|url=https://pagesix.com/2025/12/11/style/bianca-censori-debuts-jewelry-collection-inspired-by-speculums-and-scalpels/ |access-date=12 January 2026 |work=Dazed |date=11 December 2025 |language=en|url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260103153507/https://pagesix.com/2025/12/11/style/bianca-censori-debuts-jewelry-collection-inspired-by-speculums-and-scalpels/ |archive-date=3 January 2026}}</ref> 

